-- The rule the drawn one reaches through HENCE reads an ASSUME that carries a
-- default. That default IS this process's loss (nothing supplies an ASSUME the
-- way an argument is supplied), so it is reported, by way of the rule reached.
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Filer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF file, acknowledge

ASSUME `is complete` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the acknowledgement` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST acknowledge
    PROVIDED `is complete`
    WITHIN 7

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the filing` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST file
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE `the acknowledgement`
